# Git and release

- Do not commit directly on `main`. One branch per wave.
- Commit only the files for that wave. No secrets, no `.env.local`.
- Open a pull request. Wait for CI. Do not merge it yourself unless asked.
- Preview deployments are allowed. Production deploy is not, unless the user explicitly asks.
- Vercel install uses `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`.
